       "    'title': 'Protect your personal info and credit cards',\n",
       "    'text': 'The ANPKEC RFID Blocking cards were the best set of cards for the price. They arrived quickly which I greatly appreciated. My friend had her credit card scanned and used fraudulently. A women brushed up against her sling bag which was across her back. My friend felt her touch her bag and quickly turned to her. She asked the woman why are you so close and touching my bag?? The woman apologized and quickly went away. The next morning the credit card is being used at a store. These RFID cards are to protect my cards in my wallet. We have to take measures to protect our information. Sad times that we have to take measures to prevent theft.',\n",
       "    'rating': 5.0,\n",
       "    'date': 'November 10, 2025',\n",
       "    'author': 'Lynn S.',\n",
       "    'author_link': 'https://www.amazon.com/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AF5HC5LCHVZ6DUKJUJ2H7FEUL7OA/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_gw_tr?ie=UTF8',\n",
       "    'author_image': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/amazon-avatars-global/default.png',\n",
       "    'helpful_votes': '2 people found this helpful',\n",
       "    'verified_purchase': True},\n",
       "   {'position': 2,\n",
       "    'title': 'A Simple Fix for What Could Be A HUGE Problem!!!',\n",
       "    'text': \"I really appreciate how reliable these ANPKEC Blocking Cards are. It's easy to slide a credit card into the sleeve and then slip the pair into my wallet. They do make things a bit thicker, which makes fitting them into a few of the wallet’s plastic holders slightly tricky, but that might actually help keep my cards more secure. No hassles at all. The pack was exactly as described, and now my credit card information is fully protected. Highly recommended!!!\",\n",
