       "   {'position': 4,\n",
       "    'title': 'Works OK',\n",
       "    'text': 'Work OK isn’t quite what I thought but it seems to work. OK it’s not a pouch. It’s a card.',\n",
       "    'rating': 5.0,\n",
       "    'date': 'December 5, 2025',\n",
       "    'author': 'Clark R. Bachman',\n",
       "    'author_link': 'https://www.amazon.com/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AGSEQ52SPVNDQ3MSZSCHGBWVLLWA/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_gw_tr?ie=UTF8',\n",
       "    'author_image': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/amazon-avatars-global/default.png',\n",
       "    'verified_purchase': True},\n",
       "   {'position': 5,\n",
       "    'title': 'Great present to add onto a gift',\n",
       "    'text': 'These work wonderfully my sister tested them out. I gave them to her with her birthday present, so I don’t have any pictures other than her wallet that has it in it and she loves the product. She gave one to her husband, and he says that the thickness and the quality is worth your money that you’ve spent for it. He says it is extremely thick and fits just right so hopefully it lasts a long time. The Rfid does protect your cards. My sister tried it with and without it and it does just what it’s supposed to do. I think they’ll last a long time if you keep them in your wallet or in a safe place, so the durability should be good. My sister is happy that’s all that counts for me.',\n",
       "    'rating': 5.0,\n",
       "    'date': 'March 16, 2025',\n",
       "    'author': 'Jess',\n",
       "    'author_link': 'https://www.amazon.com/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AG2I2J4UCCMGO5ZCQBG6GLI2MBZQ/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_gw_tr?ie=UTF8',\n",
       "    'author_image': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/amazon-avatars-global/a55879c8-67bf-42c1-8e6a-a73f23c09b7f._CR0%2C0%2C375%2C375_UX460_.jpg',\n",
       "    'images': ['https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91+0-S5vqYL._SY88.jpg'],\n",
       "    'helpful_votes': '7 people found this helpful',\n",
       "    'verified_purchase': True},\n",
       "   {'position': 6,\n",
       "    'title': 'Cute little card holder',\n",
       "    'text': 'This is great card holder. I am most happy because it protects from theft.',\n",
       "    'rating': 5.0,\n",
       "    'date': 'October 12, 2025',\n",
       "    'author': 'Coolgram',\n",
       "    'author_link': 'https://www.amazon.com/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AEDHTXR32IPIULB7GSRFQNZQL2UA/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_gw_tr?ie=UTF8',\n",
       "    'author_image': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/amazon-avatars-global/default.png',\n",
       "    'verified_purchase': True},\n",
       "   {'position': 7,\n",
       "    'title': 'Definitely helps block RFID/NFC signals',\n",
       "    'text': \"Definitely helps block RFID/NFC signals! Before inserting the blocking cards, I tested with an RFID/NFC app on my phone and was able to scan a card in my wallet. I put a card on one side of my wallet and was no longer able to scan the card. If I turned my wallet over, I was able to scan from the other side. So I installed a second card on the other side. After that I couldn't scan the card from either side. Finally I loaded up my wallet with all my credit cards, tried scanning again and got nothing. There may be more sophisticated ways to scan, but this certainly seems to help.\",\n",
       "    'rating': 5.0,\n",
       "    'date': 'October 25, 2025',\n",
       "    'author': 'Bob',\n",
       "    'author_link': 'https://www.amazon.com/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AF5IYK73UV7472AFPJL7RQWWD3YA/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_gw_tr?ie=UTF8',\n",
       "    'author_image': 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/amazon-avatars-global/default.png',\n",
       "    'helpful_votes': '5 people found this helpful',\n",
       "    'verified_purchase': True},\n",
       "   {'position': 8,\n",
       "    'title': 'They work!',\n",
       "    'text': 'Our credit card was hacked when we went on our vacation, so we were looking for something to help protect our credit cards. I read numerous reviews on RFID blocking cards and this one sounded the best because it had two forms of protection. I bought one pack for us and one pack for my sister. My sister and l have both since tested them out at stores with tappers at the checkout. We tried putting the RFID/NFC blocking card over the front of the credit card, and then behind the credit card and tried using the tapper, and it would not work either way. As soon as we removed the RFID/NFC blocking card, we were able to use the tapper without any problem. We were both highly impressed! Knowing there are crooks out there who are actually able to scan our cards while they are in our purses or wallets; it’s very comforting to know I have this kind of quality protection for my credit cards. Of course, it’s always good to use common sense and I have since learned to buy gas at stations that have tappers or go inside to pay, as well as using tappers whenever possible at stores rather than inserting cards. I would highly recommend these!',\n",
       "    'rating': 5.0,\n",
       "    'date': 'January 10, 2025',\n",
